*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*%
*% Zebra P330i card printer (EPCL) - CUPS PPD for macOS / Linux
*% Filter: rastertoepcl (EPCL encoding derived from pyepcl, LGPLv3)
*% This PPD: SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 Matthew Puckett
*%
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0.1"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "ZBP330I.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Zebra"
*Product: "(P330i)"
*ModelName: "Zebra P330i Card Printer"
*ShortNickName: "Zebra P330i"
*NickName: "Zebra P330i Card Printer (EPCL)"
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:ZEBRA CARD PRINTER;MDL:P330i;"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: True
*DefaultColorSpace: RGB
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 2.3
*cupsModelNumber: 0
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 0 /Library/Printers/Zebra/P330i/rastertoepcl"

*% 1030 x 646 dots at 300 dpi = the printer's full print area (CR80 + bleed)
*OpenUI *PageSize/Card Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: CR80
*PageSize CR80/CR80 ID Card (full bleed): "<</PageSize[247.2 155.04]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Card Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: CR80
*PageRegion CR80/CR80 ID Card (full bleed): "<</PageSize[247.2 155.04]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: CR80
*ImageableArea CR80/CR80 ID Card (full bleed): "0 0 247.2 155.04"
*DefaultPaperDimension: CR80
*PaperDimension CR80/CR80 ID Card (full bleed): "247.2 155.04"

*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 300dpi
*Resolution 300dpi/300 DPI: "<</HWResolution[300 300]/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsColorSpace 1>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*OpenUI *ColorModel/Color Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: RGB
*ColorModel RGB/Color: "<</cupsColorOrder 0/cupsColorSpace 1/cupsBitsPerColor 8>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel

*OpenUI *zeRibbon/Ribbon: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *zeRibbon
*DefaultzeRibbon: YMCKO
*zeRibbon YMCKO/Color YMCKO: ""
*zeRibbon K/Monochrome (black resin): ""
*CloseUI: *zeRibbon

*OpenUI *zeOverlay/Overlay Varnish: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *zeOverlay
*DefaultzeOverlay: On
*zeOverlay On/Full card: ""
*zeOverlay Off/None: ""
*CloseUI: *zeOverlay

*OpenUI *zeBlackExtract/Black text on resin K panel: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *zeBlackExtract
*DefaultzeBlackExtract: Medium
*zeBlackExtract Off/Off (all composite color): ""
*zeBlackExtract Low/Pure black only: ""
*zeBlackExtract Medium/Near black (recommended): ""
*zeBlackExtract High/Dark colors too: ""
*CloseUI: *zeBlackExtract

*OpenUI *zeMonoThreshold/Monochrome threshold: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *zeMonoThreshold
*DefaultzeMonoThreshold: 128
*zeMonoThreshold 96/Lighter (96): ""
*zeMonoThreshold 128/Normal (128): ""
*zeMonoThreshold 160/Darker (160): ""
*zeMonoThreshold 192/Darkest (192): ""
*CloseUI: *zeMonoThreshold

*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier: Standard "(002.004S)" Standard ROM
*Font Helvetica: Standard "(001.006S)" Standard ROM
*Font Times-Roman: Standard "(001.007S)" Standard ROM
